        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.22.3+2KI.22.4+2KI.22.5+2KI.22.6+2KI.22.7+2KI.22.8+2KI.22.9+2KI.22.10+2KI.22.11+2KI.22.12+2KI.22.13+2KI.22.14+2KI.22.15+2KI.22.16+2KI.22.17+2KI.22.18+2KI.22.19+2KI.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 22:3-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwe gwa ikumi na munaana, ku yaaherize kushemeza ensi na hekalu, yaayohereza Shafani mwene Azalia, Maaseya omukru w'orurembo na Yoa mwene Yoahazi omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho, kuhunduuza enju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baahika owa Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru, baahayo empiiha ezaareetsirwe omu nju ya Ruhanga, ezi Abaleevi abakumiirizi baabaire bashoroize omu Bamanaase, Abaefuraimu, n'omu Baisraeli boona abaabaire batsigaireho, n'omu Bayuda n'Ababenyamiini boona, kandi n'omu batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaziha abakozi abarikureeberera enju ya MUKAMA; bwanyima abakozi abarikukora omu nju ya MUKAMA baatandika kuzikoresa kuhunduuza enju n'okugigira nsya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaziha ababaizi n'abombeki kugura amabaare agabaizire, embaaho z'okuteerana, n'emitambiko y'ebyombeko ebi abagabe ba Yuda baarekire bikasiisikara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bashaija baakora omurimo n'obwesigwa. Abaabaire nibabareeberera bakaba bari Yahasi na Obadia Abaleevi ab'omuri beene Merari, na Zekaria na Meshulaamu ab'omuri beene Kohasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi Baleevi, abaabaire bari abanyabwengye omu kuteera ebirikugamba, baareeberera abeekorezi, kandi baaguma nibeezirikisa boona abaabaire nibakora emirimo y'emiringo yoona ey'okuheereza. Kandi abandi omu Baalevi bakaba bari abahandiiki, abatware n'abakumiirizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabaire nibashohoza empiiha ezaaretsirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, Hilukia omunyamurwa yaazoora ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, ekyahandiikirwe Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilukia yaagambira Shafani omuhandiiki ati: Nzoire ekitambo ky'Ebiragiro omu nju ya MUKAMA. Atyo yaakiha Shafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafani yaakitwarira omugabe, kandi yaagambira omugabe eby'omurimo ati: Ebi abairu baawe bakwatsiibwe babikozire byona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "batwaire empiiha zoona ezibaire ziri omu nju ya MUKAMA, baaziha abarikureeberera omurimo n'abakozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Shafani omuhandiiki yaagaruka yaagambira omugabe ati: Hilukia omunyamurwa yampa ekitabo. Atyo yaakishomera omugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo by'ebiragiro, yaataagura ebijwaro bye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaaragiira Hilukia, Ahikaamu mwene Shafani, Abudooni mwene Miika, Shafani omuhandiiki na Asaaya omugaragwa w'omugabe, naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwirooko mumbuurize ahari MUKAMA, hamwe n'abatsigaire omuri Israeli na Yuda eby'ebigambo by'omuri eki kitabo ekizoirwe; ahabw'okuba ekiniga kya MUKAMA ekituriho ni kingi, ahakuba baatatenkuriitwe tibaroorobeire kigambo kya MUKAMA kukora ebihandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
